# ============================================================
#  WALLETS  —  copy this file to ".env" and add your wallets
# ============================================================
#
#  This file is git-ignored. Your keys never leave your machine.
#  One wallet per line, in any of these formats:
#
#  1) Seed phrase (address is derived automatically):
#     word1 word2 word3 ... word12
#
#  2) Address + seed phrase:
#     0xADDRESS word1 word2 word3 ... word12
#
#  3) Address + private key:
#     0xADDRESS=0xPRIVATEKEY
#
#  Lines starting with '#' are ignored.
#
#  Withdraw destination (your main wallet) is passed on the command line:
#     python collect.py withdraw --to 0xYOUR_MAIN_WALLET --live
#  ...or via the MAIN_WALLET environment variable.
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------
#  Add your wallets below:

